  "definition": "Allonge for Loans to Non-Governmental Recipients for Construction Projects",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-04-21",
  "historyNote": "#13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1405.12); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
